          "api"
        ],
        "plugin": [
          "openFile",
          "loadArchive",
          "loadFiles"
        ]
      },
      "kinds": [],
      "note": "SMScript.run is not a legacy writer since CS8-SDK (#2354): on a native document it runs through NemoScriptNativeApi, and on desktop without one it refuses; openFile, api and the plugin host stay refused until bound."
